title: CheckIfBridgePuzzleDone
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>

<<if $bridgeFixed == true>>
	Old Man: The bridge is fixed, Go save yourself!
	<<enable_controls "Player">>
	<<stop>>
<<endif>>

<<if $planksFound >= 3>>
	<<set $bridgeFixed = true>>
	You: That should hold.
	<<play_animation "BridgePlank1" "Plank1Animation" true>>
	<<play_animation "BridgePlank2" "Plank2Animation" true>>
	<<play_animation "BridgePlank3" "Plank3Animation" true>>

	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveFixTheBridge" 1>>
	<<complete_and_hide "QuestTitleBridge" 2>>
	<<show_text "QuestTitleEnding">>
	<<hide_text "BridgeWall">>

	Old Man: Good luck, get to safety! Leave me here. I'm too old...
<<else>>
	Old Man: You are still missing some planks
<<endif>>

<<enable_controls "Player">>
===

title: IntroductionToBridge
---
<<if $gotBridgeInfo == true>>
	<<jump CheckIfBridgePuzzleDone>>>>
<<endif>>

<<disable_controls "Player">>
<<face "Player" "OldMan">>
<<face "OldMan" "Player">>
<<wait 1>>>>

<<show_text "QuestTitleBridge">>

Old Man: *He Wipes sweat from his forehead a handkerchief*
Old Man: Hello, you looking for a way across? well the main bridge isn't finished yet.
Old Man: They actually haven't even started yet, just left a floting sign about construction
Old Man: Probably the same guys who made the home address signs....
You don't understand what his on about
Old Man: Anyways the bridge was supposed to be done 2 years ago
You: Figures
Old Man: It will probably be done when your grandchildren are running from the next a meteor
Old Man: As you can see a temporary bridge was set up, but the middle section collapsed last winter under a heavy snowfall. Nobody came to fix it.
You: So, no way to cross?
Old Man: Well, if you're desperate enough, three good planks would bridge the gap.
Old Man: Look around the area you will definitely find some...
Old Man: Good luck hunting for them!
The Old Man puts on a big smiles, showing his remaining three yellowed teeth.

<<show_text "ObjectiveFindEnoughPlanks">>

<<set $gotBridgeInfo = true>>
<<enable_controls "Player">>

===

title: FoundPlank
---
<<disable_controls "Player">>

<<if $planksFound >= 3>>
	You: You have enough planks already.
<<else>>
	You: You have found a plank!
	<<set $planksFound += 1>>
<<endif>>

<<enable_controls "Player">>

<<jump SetInventory>>
===

title: SetInventory
---

<<if $planksFound == 3>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemPlanks2" 1>>
	<<show_text "ItemPlanks3">>
	<<complete_and_hide "ObjectiveFindEnoughPlanks" 1>>
	<<show_text "ObjectiveFixTheBridge">>
<<elseif $planksFound == 2>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemPlanks1" 1>>
	<<show_text "ItemPlanks2">>
<<elseif $planksFound == 1>>
	<<show_text "ItemPlanks1">>
<<elseif $planksFound == 0>>
	<<complete_and_hide "ItemPlanks1" 1>>
<<endif>>

===
